#: includes/admin/views/settings-emails.php:33
msgid ""
"Hello [user-name],<br><br>Your review for [group-name] on [site-name] has "
"been approved and is now published.<br><br>Thank you for sharing your "
"thoughts with the community. View your review here: "
"[review-link]<br><br>Best regards,<br>The [site-name] Team"
msgstr ""
"Olá [user-name],<br><br>Sua avaliação para [group-name] em [site-name] foi "
"aprovada e agora está publicada.<br><br>Obrigado por compartilhar seus "
"pensamentos com a comunidade. Veja sua avaliação aqui: "
"[review-link]<br><br>Atenciosamente,<br>A Equipe [site-name]"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-emails.php:35
msgid "Your Review for [group-name] on [site-name] Was Not Approved"
msgstr "Sua Avaliação para [group-name] em [site-name] Não Foi Aprovada"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-emails.php:36
msgid ""
"Hello [user-name],<br><br>Your review for [group-name] on [site-name] was "
"not approved by the group administrator.<br><br>If you have questions about "
"our community guidelines, please contact the group admin.<br><br>Thank you "
"for your understanding.<br><br>Best regards,<br>The [site-name] Team"
